<title>USA: Lands' End plans additional office building.</title>
<headline>Lands' End plans additional office building.</headline>
<dateline>DODGEVILLE, Wis. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lands' End Inc said Wednesday it expects to break ground June 1 on construction of an additional 110,000-square-foot office building at its Dodgeville, Wis., headquarters.</p>
<p>It said completion is targeted for fall of 1998.</p>
<p>The direct marketer of clothing said its last major office expansion was in 1990, when the company moved its Chicago office staff to the Wisconsin location.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
